  - m_Id: 143456087809236999
    m_Localized: Calibrate brightness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237000
    m_Localized: Adjust until the stamp is barely visible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237001
    m_Localized: Adjust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237002
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237003
    m_Localized: Change
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237004
    m_Localized: Language for text, subtitles and the interface.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237005
    m_Localized: Shows dialogue and thoughts on screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237006
    m_Localized: Size of the subtitle text.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237007
    m_Localized: Game screen resolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237008
    m_Localized: Fullscreen, borderless window or windowed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237009
    m_Localized: Quality of shadows, lighting and effects. Lower it if the game stutters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237010
    m_Localized: How much of the scene fits on screen. Higher values help with motion sickness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237011
    m_Localized: Image brightness. The game is meant to be dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237012
    m_Localized: Sets the brightness using a reference image.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237013
    m_Localized: Volume of all game sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237014
    m_Localized: Music volume.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237015
    m_Localized: Volume of effects and ambience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237016
    m_Localized: Voice volume.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237017
    m_Localized: Camera speed when moving the mouse or stick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237018
    m_Localized: Inverts the camera's vertical movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237019
    m_Localized: Softens flickering lights, sirens and flashes. Recommended for photosensitive players.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143456087809237020
    m_Localized: Strength of camera shake during scares and events.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 143545597079363584
    m_Localized: LOADING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231775551488
    m_Localized: COLLECTED EVIDENCE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849600
    m_Localized: Drag evidence from the tray onto the corkboard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849601
    m_Localized: Drag evidence to arrange it. Click two pins to connect them. Return a card to the tray to unpin it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849602
    m_Localized: Connect this evidence to another
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849603
    m_Localized: Pin to board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849604
    m_Localized: Return to tray
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849605
    m_Localized: Hypothesis noted. Keep building the case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849606
    m_Localized: Connection selected. Use Remove connection, Delete, or right-click.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849607
    m_Localized: Remove connection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144262231997849608
    m_Localized: Connection removed. Discovered conclusions remain in the case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144276993104191488
    m_Localized: '(E) Add to case: {clue}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144276993183883264
    m_Localized: Evidence already added to case
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144283670939475968
    m_Localized: Click evidence to place it or return it. Hold and drag to arrange it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144283671069499392
    m_Localized: Choose evidence from the tray to start building the case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144283671069499393
    m_Localized: All collected evidence is on the board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144283671069499394
    m_Localized: "Pin: connect evidence \xB7 Right-click a string: remove \xB7 Esc: leave"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144283671069499395
    m_Localized: Connection selected. Delete or right-click to remove.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144289048121090048
    m_Localized: Notes / November 2003
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144289048192393216
    m_Localized: Evidence at hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 144289048192393217
    m_Localized: "Click: place or return\nPins: connect   \xB7   Right-click: cut string\nEsc: back to the apartment"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
